00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.190
-Good morning, Counselor!
-Good morning, Counselor!

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.650
It's not very convenient.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:55.580
Okay.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:56.530
That's not right.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:58.159
Shui, your inspections are too lax.

00:05:58.159 --> 00:05:59.030
You need to be more thorough.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:05:59.909
