but could you help me?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.840
Could you cover for me?

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.410
I can't. I'm from
the Education Division.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.580
But you can do it. Please.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.440
I need to use the bathroom.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.480
Everything's about to come out, you know?

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.730
-Shui, I’ll call someone for you.
-Just for a moment!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.260
-Shui!
-I’ll be right back!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:23.600
Next.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:25.750
Next one.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.100
